{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-4","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","englishTitle":"If a first magnitude have to a second the same ratio as a third to a fourth, any equimultiples whatever of the first and third will also have the same ratio to any equimultiples whatever of the second and fourth respectively, taken in corresponding order.","book":5,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","contentId":"euclid-5-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3dcff431826b0439c88c4af5fd4ee9655d8b4b996ce79e558e95a092b93cdb56","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-4.statement","euclid-5-4.construction.1","euclid-5-4.construction.2","euclid-5-4.proof.1","euclid-5-4.proof.2","euclid-5-4.proof.3","euclid-5-4.proof.4","euclid-5-4.conclusion","euclid-5-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-4","revisionId":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f3ea223f84640556677564bc6b0663cf0bef2fd07ab5f76ea1b8364d73b9daf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a first magnitude have to a second the same ratio as a third to a fourth, any equimultiples whatever of the first and third will also have the same ratio to any equimultiples whatever of the second and fourth respectively, taken in corresponding order."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一级与三级的比相同,则任何一级和三级的同倍数,无论第一和第二级的同倍数,也分别与任何二级和第四级的同倍数的比相同,按相应顺序排列。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-4","revisionId":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"706e598ba96f83ef8f9315223bf4451ca064e529f0ca72eb3a091393daf3368a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a first magnitude A have to a second B the same ratio as a third C to a fourth D; and let equimultiples E, F be taken of A, C, and G, H other, chance, equimultiples of B, D; I say that, as E is to G, so is F to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"初等A比B等于第三位C比第四位D; 初等A比E比F比A比C比C比D比F比G比H比D比同倍数比H; 我说,E比G等于F比H；E 与 G 之比等于 F 与 H 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-4.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-4","revisionId":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9e3541aef985af78dd0a10534fed2e9f37cd25962d126fcf7fe9d589902e5af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let equimultiples K, L be taken of E, F, and other, chance, equimultiples M, N of G, H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"K,L E,F,其他机会,同倍数,M,N,G,H。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-4","revisionId":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b0ae87722d3eeb95a3ed7414ae3f8ecdb912ca1590987ef9130875c5d136d06","citations":["euclid-5-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since E is the same multiple of A that F is of C, and equimultiples K, L of E, F have been taken, therefore K is the same multiple of A that L is of C. [[V. 3](/principles/euclid-5-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于E是A的乘数,F是C,同倍数 K,L是E,F是K,K是A,L是C,K是E。 [[V. 3](/principles/euclid-5-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-4","revisionId":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"398a8aa2a267bb886d60fca355c6a54926d678955ae8d633cc47b26d4daa9df8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason M is the same multiple of B that N is of D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,M是B的乘数,N是D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-4","revisionId":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8f3503e68e8292c852754673c855b3b8df01a7a3bff6b6a92f1f00aff1196d2","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since, as A is to B, so is C to D, and of A, C equimultiples K, L have been taken, and of B, D other, chance, equimultiples M, N, therefore, if K is in excess of M, L also is in excess of N, if it is equal, equal, and if less, less. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A-B的比等于C-D的比,A、C、同倍数、K、L的比,B、D其他机会,同倍数、M、N的比,因此,如果K超过M、L的比是相等的,那么,如果等于、等于、少于,则超过N；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-4.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-4","revisionId":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"453cf01c3a36fd6be3fe13782f4bf36fd1f1d444255fc3569e61b0d889dd82ed","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And K, L are equimultiples of E, F, and M, N other, chance, equimultiples of G, H; therefore, as E is to G, so is F to H. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"K,L是E,F和M,N是其他机会,G,H是同倍数;因此,E对G的比等于F对H的比；E 与 G 之比等于 F 与 H 之比。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-4","revisionId":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-4.source","contentId":"euclid-5-4","revisionId":"euclid-5-4@raw-3dcff431826b0439","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8240b436a063e6e8d3a48ac52a3fcb6f1acc926311b5a09cc27d02b64873ed4f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.4/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.4\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-4:euclid-5-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-4.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"pers